			"Message": "Refactor scripts to improve error handling and output redirection\n\n- Updated various scripts to change output redirection from `>/dev/null 2>&1` to `> /dev/null 2>&1` for consistency and clarity.\n- Ensured that error messages are redirected properly across multiple scripts including `Repository.sh`, `AbsorbGitDirs.sh`, `CommitGraph.sh`, `GarbageCollect.sh`, `PruneRemote.sh`, `Sync.sh`, `Save.sh`, and others.\n- Improved readability of command substitutions and variable assignments by adding spaces around redirection operators.\n- Enhanced error handling in `Transfer/Dependency.sh` and `Transfer/Documentation.sh` to ensure proper checks for command availability and authentication status.\n- Made minor formatting adjustments to maintain consistency across all scripts.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "27993e32484bea8467038eaada09b30b887f68cd"
		},
